# Hormozi / Analytics drop triggers

When Dale **pastes a Hormozi transcript** or says add/lock/use this teaching:

1. Run `twitter_agents/researcher/knowledge/hormozi_ingest.md` **end-to-end**
2. Do not draft tweets until leverage card + canon/notes are updated
3. Then run `hormozi_tweet_process.md` if he also wants a post

When Dale **drops an analytics CSV** (e.g. `account_analytics_content_*.csv`):

1. Run `twitter_agents/researcher/knowledge/analytics_csv_ingest.md`
2. Overwrite `twitter_agents/SHARED/recent_timeline_latest.md`
3. Only then draft via `hormozi_tweet_process.md`

Never skim a transcript into one poetic summary without file updates.  
Never draft off a stale timeline when a fresh CSV was attached this session.
